      "body": "Stacked on the 5/N cache PR. Additive config surface; no runtime change.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `BucketSpec.policy: Option<PolicyKind>` (serde default): the policy attached to a bucket; the model policy when omitted. `PolicyKind` gains `Deserialize` with the same snake_case spellings as `--policy`. Buckets cannot attach `fused_score` / `score_policy`.\n- `--selection-engine legacy|reorg` (default `legacy`) on `RoutingArgs`. It is read by `main.rs` only, not stored in `Config`, so no config literal changes; it is removed with the legacy path.\n- The two resolver options the design sketches (`affinity_first`, disabling advance-on-rejection) are deferred: their defaults reproduce today's behavior and nothing sets them yet.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\n- [x] `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`\n- [x] `cargo test --workspace --locked` (989 passed)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #35308987804](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35308987804)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35308987621](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35308987621)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
